      aria-label=\"Toggle password visibility\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n219:                                             <i class=\"fas fa-eye\"></i>\r\n220:                                         </button>\r\n221:                                     </div>\r\n222:                                 </div>\r\n223: \r\n224:                                 <div class=\"form-group checkbox-group\"\r\n225:                                     style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n226:                                     <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"trust-device\" class=\"form-checkbox\">\r\n227:                                     <label for=\"trust-device\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0; cursor: pointer;\">Trust this\r\n228:                                         device\r\n229:                                         (Stay logged in)</label>\r\n230:                                 </div>\r\n231: \r\n232:                                 <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\">\r\n233:                                     <i class=\"fas fa-sign-in-alt\"></i> Login\r\n234:                                 </button>\r\n235: \r\n236:                                 <!-- Forgot Password Link (hidden by default, shows after failed login) -->\r\n237:                                 <div id=\"forgot-password-container\" class=\"forgot-password-container\">\r\n238:                                     <a href=\"#\" id=\"forgot-password-link\" class=\"forgot-password-link\">Forgot\r\n239:                                         Password?</a>\r\n240:                                 </div>\r\n241: \r\n242:                                 <div class=\"auth-divider\">\r\n243:                                     <span>Don't have an account?</span>\r\n244:                                 </div>\r\n245: \r\n246:                                 <button type=\"button\" id=\"show-signup-btn\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\">\r\n247:                                     Create Account\r\n248:                                 </button>\r\n249:                             </form>\r\n250: \r\n251:                             <!-- Signup Form (hidden by default) -->\r\n252:                             <form id=\"signup-form\" class=\"auth-form\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n253:                                 <h2>Create Account</h2>\r\n254: \r\n255:                                 <!-- Role Toggle (Student / Faculty) -->\r\n256:                                 <div class=\"auth-role-toggle\" id=\"signup-role-toggle\">\r\n257:                                     <button type=\"button\" class=\"role-toggle-btn active\" data-role=\"student\"\r\n258:                                         id=\"signup-role-student\">\r\n259:                                         <i class=\"fas fa-user-graduate\"></i> Student\r\n260:                                     </button>\r\n261:                                     <button type=\"button\" class=\"role-toggle-btn\" data-role=\"faculty\"\r\n262:                                         id=\"signup-role-faculty\">\r\n263:                                         <i class=\"fas fa-chalkboard-teacher\"></i> Faculty\r\n264:                                     </button>\r\n265:                                 </div>\r\n266: \r\n267:                                 <div class=\"form-group\">\r\n268:                                     <label for=\"signup-email\">Email Address</label>\r\n269:                                     <input type=\"email\" id=\"signup-email\" class=\"form-input\"\r\n270:                                         placeholder=\"student@example.com\" required autocomplete=\"email\">\r\n271:                                 </div>\r\n272: \r\n273:                                 <div class=\"form-group\">\r\n274:                                     <label for=\"signup-password\">Password</label>\r\n275:                                     <div class=\"password-input-wrapper\">\r\n276:                                         <input type=\"password\" id=\"signup-password\" class=\"form-input\"\r\n277:                                             placeholder=\"At least 6 characters\" required autocomplete=\"new-password\">\r\n278:                                         <button type=\"button\" class=\"password-toggle-btn\"\r\n279:                                             aria-label=\"Toggle password visibility\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n280:                                             <i class=\"fas fa-eye\"></i>\r\n281:                                         </button>\r\n282:                                     </div>\r\n283:                                 </div>\r\n284: \r\n285:                                 <div class=\"form-group\">\r\n286:                                     <label for=\"signup-confirm-password\">Confirm Password</label>\r\n287:                                     <div class=\"password-input-wrapper\">\r\n288:                                         <input type=\"password\" id=\"signup-confirm-password\" class=\"form-input\"\r\n289:                                             placeholder=\"Re-enter password\" required autocomplete=\"new-password\">\r\n290:                                         <button type=\"button\" class=\"password-toggle-btn\"\r\n291:                                             aria-label=\"Toggle password visibility\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n292:                                             <i class=\"fas fa-eye\"></i>\r\n293:                                         </button>\r\n294:                                     </div>\r\n295:                                 </div>\r\n296: \r\n297:                                 <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\">\r\n298:                                     <i class=\"fas fa-user-plus\"></i> Sign Up\r\n299:                                 </button>\r\n300: \r\n301:                                 <div class=\"auth-divider\">\r\n302:                                     <span>Already have an account?</span>\r\n303:                                 </div>\r\n304: \r\n305:                                 <button type=\"button\" id=\"show-login-btn\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\">\r\n306:                                     Back to Login\r\n307:                                 </button>\r\n308:                             </form>\r\n309: \r\n310:                             <button type=\"button\" id=\"visitor-mode-btn\" class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block visitor-mode-btn\"\r\n311:                                 title=\"Browse sample tasks and notices without an account\">\r\n312:                                 <i class=\"fas fa-eye\"></i> Browse as Visitor (Preview)\r\n313:                             </button>\r\n314: \r\n315:                             <!-- Error/Success Messages -->\r\n316:                             <div id=\"auth-message\" class=\"auth-message\"></div>\r\n317:                         </div>\r\n318: \r\n319:                         <!-- Scroll Down Animation Indicator -->\r\n320:                         <div class=\"login-scroll-indicator\" id=\"login-scroll-indicator\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"\r\n321:                             title=\"Scroll down to FAQ & Support\">\r\n322:                             <span>FAQ & Support</span>\r\n323:                             <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i>\r\n324:                         </div>\r\n325:                     </div>\r\n326: \r\n327:                     <!-- Login Footer & Support / FAQ Section -->\r\n328:                     <div class=\"login-footer-section\" id=\"login-footer-section\">\r\n329:                         <!-- Telegram Contact Card -->\r\n330:                         <div class=\"telegram-contact-card\">\r\n331:                             <div class=\"telegram-contact-icon\">\r\n332:                                 <i class=\"fab fa-telegram-plane\"></i>\r\n333:                             </div>\r\n334:                             <div class=\"telegram-contact-content\">\r\n335:                                 <h3>Need Help or Have Inquiries?</h3>\r\n336:                                 <p>Join the official <strong>oU1TS</strong> Telegram group for immediate assistance,\r\n337:                                     university updates, announcements, and feedback.</p>\r\n338:                                 <a href=\"https://t.me/oUITS_res\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\r\n339:                                     class=\"btn btn-telegram\">\r\n340:                                     <i class=\"fab fa-telegram\"></i> Join Telegram @oUITS_res\r\n341:                                 </a>\r\n342:                             </div>\r\n343:                         </div>\r\n344: \r\n345:                         <!-- FAQ Accordion -->\r\n346:                         <div class=\"login-faq-container\">\r\n347:                             <div class=\"login-faq-header\">\r\n348:                                 <h2><i class=\"fas fa-question-circle\"></i> Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\r\n349:                                 <p>Everything you need to know about accessing and using b1t-Sched.</p>\r\n350:                             </div>\r\n351: \r\n352:                             <details class=\"login-faq-item\">\r\n353:                                 <summary class=\"login-faq-question\">\r\n354:                                     <i class=\"fas fa-info-circle\"></i> How does b1t-Sched work?\r\n355:                                 </summary>\r\n356:                                 <div class=\"login-faq-answer\">\r\n357:                                     <p>b1t-Sched groups students by their academic identity —\r\n358:                                         <strong>Department</strong>, <strong>Semester</strong>, and\r\n359:                                         <strong>Section</strong>. All users who share the same academic combination\r\n360:                                         automatically see the section-level <strong>Pending Tasks</strong> and\r\n361:                                         <strong>Class Notices</strong>.</p>\r\n362:                                 </div>\r\n363:                             </details>\r\n364: \r\n365:                             <details class=\"login-faq-item\">\r\n366:                                 <summary class=\"login-faq-question\">\r\n367:                                     <i class=\"fas fa-user-check\"></i> Student vs. Faculty Login & Sign-Up\r\n368:                                 </summary>\r\n369:                                 <div class=\"login-faq-answer\">\r\n370:                                     <p><strong>Students:</strong> Sign up with your university email. In Set Details,\r\n371:                                         provide your <strong>10–16 digit Student ID</strong> along with your Department,\r\n372:                                         Semester, and Section. You can log in using either your Student ID or your\r\n373:                                         registered email address.</p>\r\n374:                                     <p><strong>Faculty:</strong> Toggle the <strong>Facu
